"""tally — CI gate: woof --only prose, plus --chg on fence numbers.

woof projected markdown fences in the tagged dialect so a timeout sample is
number ply. A *new* bash sample then floods ident inserts and drowns 30→60.
tally --chg: fence ident/kw/string flood is not a leak. Fence numbers leak
only on *change* (30→60). A new sample's 2048 insert is not a number leak.
Mixed-line 30→60 on a code path still FAIL. Not snag --forbid number:
comment-interior stays comment ply.

Default is the gate, not a dump. stdin is a unified diff. TSV only on --emit.
"""
